note ---- issues of the native store (collab/co5iss.om): forge/issues/1 and forge/issue/1. An imported
note issue has "author": null and an "imported" object naming its GitHub source and login (plain data,
note never an account or a DID of this forge); the first comment is the issue body, as on the page.
