note nighlt a c: gnf[a, a+20) sorts before gngh[c, c+20)
fn nighlt a ulong c ulong to bool
for i ulong 20
x = get gnf add a i
y = get gngh add c i
if ne x y
ret lt x y
end
end
ret false
end
fn nithlt c ulong to bool
for i ulong 20
x = get gnf i
y = get gnth add c i
if ne x y
ret lt x y
end
end
ret false
end
note nijraw a: gnth[gnr a, + gnr a+1) as a JSON string
fn nijraw a ulong to void
